  "contentHtml": "<p>실험실 안전에 대한 수업.</p><p>주어진 사진에서 잘못된 점 조별로 찾아보기. (구글링으로 찾은 자료입니다)</p><p>&#160;</p><p>비상교과서 부록 실험기구 사용 및 안전수칙 (1학년 교과서) 을 활용하여 마무리. 비바샘에서 다운로드 가능.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/00000b57838784e6ad1b0b7a0bfc0518b57f9302?download\" data-file-name=\"실험실 안전.png\" data-file-size=\"87601\" data-mimetype=\"image/png\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3Df9eS%26dataid%3D23%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20220227120534&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F00000b57838784e6ad1b0b7a0bfc0518b57f9302')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">실험실 안전</span><span class=\"type\">.png</span></div><div class=\"size\">85.55KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/71957a50b8ba71cf39466b2776e2b255696bf8a4?download\" data-file-name=\"lab safety 1.jpg\" data-file-size=\"95436\" data-mimetype=\"image/jpeg\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3Df9eS%26dataid%3D23%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20220227120534&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F71957a50b8ba71cf39466b2776e2b255696bf8a4')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">lab safety 1</span><span class=\"type\">.jpg</span></div><div class=\"size\">93.20KB</div></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
